  <name>superv</name>
  <summary>Clipboard history and emoji picker</summary>
  <description>
    <p>A Win+V-style clipboard history for Linux. Copy text and images, then open the popup with a hotkey to paste any of them again. Pin items, search your history, and pick emoji and symbols.</p>
    <p>superv records everything you copy, including passwords. History is stored locally and never leaves your machine.</p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.superv.Clipboard.desktop</launchable>
